    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>graphite</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>diamond</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#916;G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi>diamond</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi>graphite</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.9</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>&nbsp; at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;bar</p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>dG</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>dP</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi>&#916;G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></munderover><mi>&#916;V</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>dP</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>&#916;G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;V</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.9</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.9</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>Pa</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.45</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>bar</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>14501</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>bar</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
